---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <h1 class="page-heading">About</h1>

  <div class="info-card">
    <p>
      Hi, I'm Gil, a software engineer at Tesla based in San Francisco.
      Before this, I led mission-driven engineering teams in healthtech at
      companies like Oscar and Thirty Madison.
    </p>
    <p>
      I write here about the parts of the job that don't show up in a diff:
      what changes when you become responsible for the people writing the
      code, the career decisions that look small at the time, and the things
      I got wrong along the way.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ul class="tag-list">
    <li>Leadership</li>
    <li>Management</li>
    <li>Engineering Teams</li>
    <li>Career</li>
    <li>Healthtech</li>
    <li>San Francisco</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
